+# Shlomif_Common.cmake — vendored copy for the OpenHarmony PC Conan package
+# of rinutils 0.10.3.
+#
+# Upstream: https://github.com/shlomif/shlomif-cmake-modules
+#           (shlomif-cmake-modules/shlomif-cmake-modules/Shlomif_Common.cmake)
+# License: MIT — Copyright (c) 2012 Shlomi Fish. The upstream license text is
+#          preserved below.
+#
+# Why this file is vendored / trimmed:
+#   * cmake/shlomif_common_bootstrap.cmake FILE(DOWNLOAD)s this module from
+#     GitHub whenever it is missing; a hermetic OHOS build must not depend on
+#     network access at configure time. The vendored copy is found first, so
+#     the download branch is never taken (a companion patch also turns that
+#     branch into a fatal error instead of a silent download).
+#   * Only the macros used by rinutils' CMakeLists.txt are kept:
+#     SHLOMIF_COMMON_SETUP / READ_VERSION_FROM_VER_TXT /
+#     SHLOMIF_ADD_COMMON_C_FLAGS / SHLOMIF_FINALIZE_FLAGS plus their internal
+#     helpers (CHOMP / add_flags / ADD_GCC_DEBUG_WARNING_FLAGS). The macro
+#     bodies are unchanged from upstream master except:
+#       - the unconditional include(FindPerl) + FATAL_ERROR block is dropped
+#         (this project never invokes pod2man or any other perl helper);
+#       - SHLOMIF_COMMON_SETUP no longer copies the module from a system
+#         install directory (the module is already present in cmake/).
